          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"60-perceptual-metric-self-test\">6.0 \u2014 Perceptual metric self-test</h2>\n<h2 id=\"61-clipping-discriminator\">6.1 \u2014 Clipping discriminator</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Validates that the metrics catch the known failure mode: a model that sounds\n<strong>too clean</strong> vs one that captures clipping character.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Two <strong>hand-built synthetic signals</strong> are compared (neither is a zoo model):</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>linear_approx</code></strong> \u2014 3 kHz low-pass linear EQ applied to dry signal, RMS-scaled to match target level</li>\n<li><strong><code>clipped</code></strong> \u2014 dry signal hard-clipped at 6\u00d7 gain (\u00b10.5), then 100 Hz high-pass filtered</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Correct result: <code>linear_approx</code> should score <strong>worse</strong> than <code>clipped</code> on\n<code>harmonic_weighted</code>, <code>masking_weighted</code>, and <code>signal_adaptive_weighted</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "jxvo",
