            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>2/6 metrics</strong> correctly score <code>linear_approx</code> worse than <code>clipped</code>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='jxvo-0' random-id='9a312939-23a3-5efd-fd6d-dd5e12eee0a6'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;mel_axis&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;64.6162&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;60.6998&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2713&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;equal_loudness&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.0185&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.0645&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2717&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;masking&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.0248&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.0167&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2713&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;signal_adaptive&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;23.7861&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;94.4811&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2717&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;guitar_prior&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.1355&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.4698&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2717&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Metric&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;harmonic&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear_approx&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.0432&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;clipped&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;0.1144&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;linear worse?&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;\u2717&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='6' data-total-columns='4' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-selection='&quot;multi&quot;' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='true' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003e4 metric(s) marked \u2717&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e do not correctly distinguish a linear approximation from clipped audio on this signal. Treat their scores with caution until the composite weighting is validated against listening tests.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;warn&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
